        "Type": "POLICY_TRADITION",
        "Name": "Tradition",
        "Help": "Tradition concentrates in the early game on to grow a core set of Cities with improved yields from Buildings and an impressive Capital. Supports and rewards generating Great People throughout the game.\nAdopting Tradition grants:\n* +3 Food, +2 Population, and +2 Happiness in the Capital.\n* +1 Culture in the Capital for every 2 Citizens.\nEach Tradition policy unlocked grants:\n* +1 Food in every City, and +1 Science in your Capital.\nAdopting all Policies in Tradition grants:\n* Unlocks building the University of Sankore.\n* +1 Food and Production from all Great Person Improvements and Landmarks.\n* Throne Room built in Capital (+10% to all Yields, +1 City tile working range, 1 Great Work of Music slot, 1 Musician Slot).\n* Allows for the purchase of Great Engineers with Faith starting in the Industrial Era.",
